 prone to sarcasm. She's also one to speak in an abusive language. However, those traits of hers are just bluffs to make her look like an adult, and gloss over her youthfulness. In reality, she's lonely, very emotional, and wants someone to depend on and spoil her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c23460"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から抱いていた思慕の気持ちを抑えられず、自分からその思いを告白すると共に関係を望んだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は大人びて冷静なものであり、ずけずけと文句と皮肉、そして罵詈雑言を口にするタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それは虚勢と自分の幼さを誤魔化すためのものであり、実際はかなりさびしがり屋で甘えたがり屋、そしてかなり感情的。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2584","sourceWorkId":"19913","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から抱いていた思慕の気持ちを抑えられず、自分からその思いを告白すると共に関係を望んだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は大人びて冷静なものであり、ずけずけと文句と皮肉、そして罵詈雑言を口にするタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それは虚勢と自分の幼さを誤魔化すためのものであり、実際はかなりさびしがり屋で甘えたがり屋、そしてかなり感情的。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"142947"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c2eba6f2dda3d77f74bed5f789cab136efcaf724e7ef8bf35bca29264bdaf48.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/5509190dd92b2c0d999afbce1ad66a1426ab3bb54b43d56b1025e43966cb175c.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:95594:142947:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64608","characterName":"川添 脩一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64608"},"originalCharacterName":"川添 脩一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very ordinary company employee."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has a family of 4 which comprises himself, his wife Mamiko whom he dated since their college days, their first daughter Miki, and their newborn first son."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He seems like a normal man one can find anywhere, but actually, he's in an affair with his own daughter Miki. They spend their days as father and daughter inside their home, and lovers while outside."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, he's unsure if he really sees Miki in a romantic light."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64608"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64609","characterName":"川添 まみこ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64609"},"originalCharacterName":"川添 まみこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The wife of Shuuichi, and the mother of Miki. She got acquainted with Shuuichi when they were students, and eventually got married. Now they have a daughter and a son, and lives as a family of 4."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Currently, she's a full time housewife, and looks after her newborn first son. As it appears, Mamiko prefers a son more than a daughter, so her relationship with Miki who is in a rebellious age isn't in a good state."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64609"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/416560ae90b32e010f40be8d5207a336b9f057a7a9dec042a4e71c4091435dba.webp","fallback